        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ricky Watters, Chris Berman\n- Organizations: ESPN, National Sports Media Association\n- Concepts: receiving skills, high-step running style, sportscasting awards\n\nFacts:\n- Chris Berman was a six-time honoree of the National Sports Media Association's National Sportscaster of the Year award.\n- Chris Berman was instrumental in establishing ESPN's lasting popularity during the network's formative years.\n- Ricky Watters was known throughout his playing career for outstanding receiving skills and a unique high-step running style.\n- ESPN sportcaster Chris Berman gave Ricky Watters the nickname Ricky \"Running\" Watters.",
